    <p>Bayside Bud Shack is a Midcoast Maine cannabis dispensary on US Route 1 in Northport. The storefront sits near the Northport / Lincolnville town line — the mailing address is Lincolnville, ME 04849, but the storefront and primary location are referenced as Northport. Either way, the address is 1369 Atlantic Highway.</p>
    <p>The operator runs a dual-menu dispensary with separate Medical and Recreational menus available through Leafly and the operator's own site. Online pre-order for in-store pickup is supported, which is useful for the Midcoast tourism corridor that sees significant summer traffic.</p>
  </section>

