    <strong>Hours (verify by phone):</strong> Generally 10am-6pm daily, with shorter Sunday hours. The Yelp listing and operator's site have the current schedule.</p>
    <p>Northport is a small coastal town in Waldo County, Maine, on the western shore of Penobscot Bay. The town sits between Belfast (to the north) and Lincolnville (to the south) on US Route 1. The Northport / Lincolnville corridor is a popular Midcoast tourism region with significant summer seasonal traffic from Boston, Portland, and inland Maine visitors.</p>
    <p>Parking is on-site at the storefront. Public transit is limited in this corridor — most visitors drive.</p>
  </section>

